#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example has a front-facing sensor configured to only detect things down low. Moving point targets are defined to follow on lane edges at 5-m intevals in front of the sensor.
#
#A CarSim Sensors license is required to run this simulation.  You may still view the animation and plots.
#
#A quick double-lane change is made to show how the lane edge targets reset with vehicle position.
#
#The VS Commands for the alerts are simple and show the lane departure alerts even though the lane change was probably a deliberate driver action.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

